  "body": "### Summary\nAs a maintainer, I want the app to build without Swift 6 concurrency warnings, so that real isolation bugs are not drowned and the code stays valid when warnings become errors. The operator's Xcode build of dev-swift (2026-11-27) shows 7 warnings, all « main actor-isolated … from a nonisolated context ».\n\n### Warnings (operator's Xcode, 2026-11-27)\n| File | Warning | Since |\n|---|---|---|\n| `App/SwiftHFR/Common/ListLook.swift` | call to main actor-isolated static method `strength(scheme:contrast:weight:)` from `selectedStrength(…)` (isolation inferred from `View` conformance) | #1347 `1f68a7f3` |\n| `App/SwiftHFR/Composer/MinimumHitRegion.swift` | main actor-isolated static property `hitSize` referenced from nonisolated `overhang(of:)` | #1292 `c9201214` |\n| `App/SwiftHFR/Messages/MessageRowInfoLine.swift` | call to main actor-isolated static method `avatarSubject(of:)` in a synchronous nonisolated context (`make(thread:flagLabel:now:)`) | #747 `ccdea053` |\n| `App/SwiftHFR/Navigation/PagerToolbar.swift` | call to main actor-isolated initializer `init(current:total:isExact:isLoading:onJump:drawsGlass:)` from `statusView(in:)` | #1294 `8d933d8b` |\n| `App/SwiftHFR/Root/TabBarReselectionObserver.swift` | main actor-isolated property `previousDelegate` referenced from a nonisolated context (×3) | #1318 `f03e9ead` |\n\n### Scope\n- Fix the isolation at its root, per case: mark the pure helpers `nonisolated` when they touch no main-actor state (the preferred fix for constants and pure functions), or make the caller `@MainActor` when it really runs on the main actor. No `@preconcurrency`, no `nonisolated(unsafe)`, no `MainActor.assumeIsolated` without a written reason.\n- The `TabBarReselectionObserver` delegate forwarding (UIKit `UITabBarControllerDelegate`) runs on the main thread: isolate the class or the methods accordingly.\n\n### Acceptance\n- The CI app build log (`App build + tests` / `Compile check`) shows none of these warnings (grep the job log for `warning:` on the five files); no new warning; all tests green.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
