   "body": "/claim cloud/i1364-sonnet\n\nPlan:\n- Branch `fix/1364-isolation-warnings` from dev-swift; draft PR early.\n- Per case, fix at the root: `nonisolated` on pure helpers/constants (ListLook.strength, MinimumHitRegion.hitSize, MessageRowInfoLine.avatarSubject), and the right isolation on callers (PagerToolbar.statusView, TabBarReselectionObserver delegate).\n- No `@preconcurrency`, no `nonisolated(unsafe)`, no `assumeIsolated` without a written reason; no behaviour change, tests untouched.\n- Proof: `compile-check` label, grep the Compile check job log for the five files, shown in the PR body.\n- Self-review against LESSONS, Opus adversarial review (max 3 rounds), ready line on #893.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
